== Trivia ==
*In update 0.8.1, '''Clerk Seraphine''' was demoted from her previous position from Mayor to Clerk, in preparation for the [[Mayor Election]]s.
*She used to be present in the [[Election Room]] during [[Mayor Election#Dante Election|Dante Elections]]. However, she was replaced by [[Clerk Goon]], because it was a mistake made by the admins.
**When [[Dante]] was elected, Seraphine's spot in the [[Community Center]] and in the [[Election Room]] was replaced with [[Clerk Goon]].

